  "title": "Every outcome is a finite bit string",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "5b97e4a5-fed6-4b3c-bb5b-eab4065d0b53",
      "text": "Because irreversible classical encoding costs at least ln 2 kT per bit, every recordable measurement outcome is a finite bit string, never an unrestricted real number.",
